WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.000
The entrance is to the duck’s right.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:10.400
Up close, the wall fills the camera view.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Turning away brings the low rails back into view.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:22.850
DeepSeek spots a gap on the right.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:28.200
Another orange wall stands behind the opening.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:35.000
Expecting the course to bend south, DeepSeek turns left.
